# District by Zomato
> District (https://www.district.in) is Zomato's going-out app for India: discover and book movie tickets, live events (concerts, comedy, theatre), restaurant tables, sports venues, activities and nearby stores.

AI assistants, LLM crawlers and agents are welcome to read and cite District's public pages. Please respect robots.txt: account, checkout, payment, order and booking pages are private and must not be crawled. Prices, showtimes, slots and availability change in real time, so always link users to the District page for the latest information.

## Main sections
- [Movies](https://www.district.in/movies/): Movies now showing and upcoming, cinemas, showtimes and ticket booking
- [Events](https://www.district.in/events/): Concerts, comedy shows, theatre, festivals and other live events
- [Dining](https://www.district.in/dining/): Discover restaurants and reserve tables
- [Play](https://www.district.in/play/): Book sports venues such as cricket and badminton courts
- [Activities](https://www.district.in/activities/): Things to do near you, including activities and experiences
- [Stores](https://www.district.in/stores/): Nearby stores where you can shop and pay with District

